    {
      "id": "authorize",
      "description": "crates/kernel/src/rules.rs authorize with no lookup (authorize-needing without coverage): default deny; the owner role is allowed everything (policy:builtin_owner); a permission of one of the principal's roles (effective-permissions) on the object type and for the verb of the action grants, before any policy (permission:role, whose detail is the request, as an unconditional policy's is); otherwise the policies of the schema, in id order, that match role, action and resource are tried: the first without a condition, or whose condition evaluates to true, grants alone; a condition that is false, null or fails to evaluate is a failed check policy:<id>; with no matching policy the one check is policy:none. Without a lookup a condition that follows a reference (through) fails to evaluate, as in the kernel.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "tenant",
          "type": "tenant-state"
        },
        {
          "name": "schema",
          "type": "tenant-schema"
        },
        {
          "name": "principal",
          "type": "principal"
        },
        {
          "name": "now",
          "type": "timestamp"
        },
        {
          "name": "action",
          "type": "action"
        },
        {
          "name": "resource",
          "type": "resource"
        },
        {
          "name": "subject",
          "type": "subject"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "policy-decision",
      "body": "call authorize-needing(tenant, schema, principal, now, action, resource, subject, null)",
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "The owner bypasses the policies: no policy names the owner, and it may delete a post.",
          "args": {
            "now": 1800000000000,
            "tenant": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-state-1"
            },
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-1"
            },
            "principal": {
              "user": "user:admin"
            },
            "action": "delete",
            "resource": {
              "object": "post"
            },
            "subject": {
              "fixture": "fx-subject-1"
            }
          },
          "result": {
            "allowed": true,
            "checks": [
              {
                "rule": "policy:builtin_owner",
                "passed": true,
                "what": "Delete on Object(ObjectTypeId(\"post\"))",
                "outcome": "owner"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
