        {
          "description": "A policy on every object that reads no field but fails its check for another reason is refused with the check's error, not as a field read.",
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "policy": {
              "id": "ghostly",
              "role": "writer",
              "resource": "any-object",
              "actions": [
                "delete"
              ],
              "condition": {
                "has-role": "ghost"
              }
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "policy ghostly: unknown role ghost"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-problems",
      "description": "schema.rs TenantSchema::problems, one workflow: an unknown object type (nothing else is checked), a field that is unknown or not a string, no initial state, and per transition a guard and each set expression (in field order) that does not check, and a set field the type does not declare.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "schema",
          "type": "tenant-schema"
        },
        {
          "name": "roles",
          "type": "list<role-id>"
        },
        {
          "name": "workflow",
          "type": "workflow-def"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "list<string>",
      "let": [
        {
          "name": "at",
          "expr": "format('workflow {}', workflow.id)"
        }
      ],
      "body": "match get(schema.objects, workflow.object) { None => [format('{}: unknown object type {}', at, workflow.object)], Some(o) => let env = expr-check-env{fields: call field-shapes(o.fields), params: [], roles} in concat(concat(match get(o.fields, workflow.field) { Some(f) => match f.ty { str => [], _ => [format('{}: field {} is not a string', at, workflow.field)] }, None => [format('{}: unknown field {}', at, workflow.field)] }, if workflow.initial == [] then [format('{}: no initial state', at)] else []), fold(t in workflow.transitions, ps = [], concat(concat(ps, match t.guard { Some(g) => match check(tenant-rule-language, g, env) { Ok(_) => [], Err(e) => [format('{}.{}: guard: {}', at, t.name, e)] }, None => [] }), fold(k in keys(t.set), qs = [], concat(concat(qs, if get(o.fields, k) == null then [format('{}.{}: sets unknown field {}', at, t.name, k)] else []), match get(t.set, k) { Some(e2) => match check(tenant-rule-language, e2, env) { Ok(_) => [], Err(e) => [format('{}.{}: set {}: {}', at, t.name, k, e)] }, None => [] }))))) }",
      "examples": [
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "workflow": {
              "fixture": "fx-workflow-def-1"
            }
          },
          "result": []
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "workflow": {
              "fixture": "fx-workflow-def-1",
              "with": {
                "id": "w",
                "object": "tag"
              }
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "workflow w: unknown object type tag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "workflow": {
              "id": "w",
              "object": "note",
              "field": "rank",
              "initial": [],
              "transitions": [
                {
                  "name": "go",
                  "from": "a",
                  "to": "b",
                  "guard": {
                    "cmp": {
                      "op": "eq",
                      "left": {
                        "param": "p"
                      },
                      "right": {
                        "lit": {
                          "str": "x"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "set": {
                    "colour": {
                      "lit": {
                        "str": "red"
                      }
                    },
                    "rank": {
                      "var": {
                        "scope": "old",
                        "field": "nope"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "workflow w: field rank is not a string",
            "workflow w: no initial state",
            "workflow w.go: guard: undeclared parameter p",
            "workflow w.go: sets unknown field colour",
            "workflow w.go: set rank: unknown field nope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "workflow": {
              "fixture": "fx-workflow-def-1",
              "with": {
                "id": "w",
                "field": "mood"
              }
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "workflow w: unknown field mood"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "query-problems",
      "description": "schema.rs TenantSchema::problems, one query: an unknown object type (nothing else is checked), a filter that does not check against the fields and the query's parameters, and each order key read as record.<field> that does not check.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "schema",
          "type": "tenant-schema"
        },
        {
          "name": "roles",
          "type": "list<role-id>"
        },
        {
          "name": "query",
          "type": "query-def"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "list<string>",
      "let": [
        {
          "name": "at",
          "expr": "format('query {}', query.id)"
        }
      ],
      "body": "match get(schema.objects, query.object) { None => [format('{}: unknown object type {}', at, query.object)], Some(o) => let env = expr-check-env{fields: call field-shapes(o.fields), params: query.params, roles} in concat(match query.filter { Some(fl) => match check(tenant-rule-language, fl, env) { Ok(_) => [], Err(e) => [format('{}: filter: {}', at, e)] }, None => [] }, fold(k in query.order, ps = [], match check(tenant-rule-language, expr.var{scope: scope.record, field: k.field}, env) { Ok(_) => ps, Err(e) => concat(ps, [format('{}: order: {}', at, e)]) })) }",
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "testkit.rs notes_schema note_by_slug",
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "query": {
              "id": "note_by_slug",
              "object": "note",
              "filter": {
                "cmp": {
                  "op": "eq",
                  "left": {
                    "var": {
                      "scope": "record",
                      "field": "slug"
                    }
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "param": "slug"
                  }
                }
              },
              "params": [
                "slug"
              ],
              "order": [],
              "limit": 1
            }
          },
          "result": []
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "query": {
              "id": "q",
              "object": "note",
              "filter": {
                "cmp": {
                  "op": "eq",
                  "left": {
                    "var": {
                      "scope": "record",
                      "field": "slug"
                    }
                  },
                  "right": {
                    "param": "slug"
                  }
                }
              },
              "params": [],
              "order": [
                {
                  "field": "$created_at",
                  "descending": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "mood",
                  "descending": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "query q: filter: undeclared parameter slug",
            "query q: order: unknown field mood"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-4"
            },
            "roles": [
              "editor",
              "owner",
              "public",
              "writer"
            ],
            "query": {
              "id": "q",
              "object": "tag",
              "params": [],
              "order": []
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "query q: unknown object type tag"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-problems",
      "description": "schema.rs TenantSchema::problems, one section of a view: an unknown query (nothing else is checked); per argument (in name order) a parameter the query does not declare and a section source that is unknown, not single or itself depends on a section; an included field that is not a reference and a markdown field that is not a string.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "schema",
          "type": "tenant-schema"
        },
        {
          "name": "view",
          "type": "view-def"
        },
        {
          "name": "at",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "name": "sec",
          "type": "view-section"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "list<string>",
      "let": [
        {
          "name": "here",
          "expr": "format('{}.{}', at, name)"
        }
      ],
      "body": "match get(schema.queries, sec.query) { None => [format('{}: unknown query {}', here, sec.query)], Some(q) => concat(fold(arg in keys(sec.args), ps = [], concat(concat(ps, if any(p in q.params, p == arg) then [] else [format('{}: query has no parameter {}', here, arg)]), match get(sec.args, arg) { Some(src) => match src { section{section: other} => match get(view.sections, other) { Some(dep) => if !dep.single then [format('{}: section {} is not single', here, other)] else if any(a in values(dep.args), match a { section => true, _ => false }) then [format('{}: section {} itself depends on a section', here, other)] else [], None => [format('{}: unknown section {}', here, other)] }, _ => [] }, None => [] })), match get(schema.objects, q.object) { Some(o) => concat(fold(f in sec.include, ps = [], if match get(o.fields, f) { Some(d) => call ref-target(d.ty) != null, None => false } then ps else concat(ps, [format('{}: {} is not a reference field', here, f)])), fold(f in sec.markdown, ps = [], if match get(o.fields, f) { Some(d) => match d.ty { str => true, _ => false }, None => false } then ps else concat(ps, [format('{}: {} is not a string field', here, f)]))), None => [] }) }",
      "examples": [
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-5"
            },
            "view": {
              "fixture": "fx-view-def-1"
            },
            "at": "view note",
            "name": "note",
            "sec": {
              "query": "note_by_slug",
              "args": {
                "slug": {
                  "route": "slug"
                }
              },
              "include": [
                "author"
              ],
              "markdown": [
                "body"
              ],
              "single": true
            }
          },
          "result": []
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-5"
            },
            "view": {
              "fixture": "fx-view-def-2"
            },
            "at": "view bad",
            "name": "b",
            "sec": {
              "query": "note_by_slug",
              "args": {
                "slug": {
                  "section": {
                    "section": "a",
                    "attribute": "slug"
                  }
                },
                "x": {
                  "const": {
                    "str": "1"
                  }
                }
              },
              "include": [
                "title"
              ],
              "markdown": [
                "rank"
              ],
              "single": false
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "view bad.b: section a is not single",
            "view bad.b: query has no parameter x",
            "view bad.b: title is not a reference field",
            "view bad.b: rank is not a string field"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "view-problems",
      "description": "schema.rs TenantSchema::problems, one view: a route that does not start with /, a route an earlier view (in id order) took, then each section in name order.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "schema",
          "type": "tenant-schema"
        },
        {
          "name": "view",
          "type": "view-def"
        },
        {
          "name": "taken",
          "type": "list<string>"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "list<string>",
      "let": [
        {
          "name": "at",
          "expr": "format('view {}', view.id)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p1",
          "expr": "concat(if call text-starts-with(view.route, '/') then [] else [format('{}: route must start with /', at)], if any(r in taken, r == view.route) then [format('{}: route {} is already taken', at, view.route)] else [])"
        }
      ],
      "body": "fold(name in keys(view.sections), ps = p1, match get(view.sections, name) { None => ps, Some(s) => concat(ps, call section-problems(schema, view, at, name, s)) })",
      "examples": [
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-5"
            },
            "view": {
              "fixture": "fx-view-def-1"
            },
            "taken": [
              "/"
            ]
          },
          "result": []
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-5"
            },
            "view": {
              "fixture": "fx-view-def-1",
              "with": {
                "id": "again"
              }
            },
            "taken": [
              "/notes/:slug"
            ]
          },
          "result": [
            "view again: route /notes/:slug is already taken"
          ]
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-5"
            },
            "view": {
              "fixture": "fx-view-def-2"
            },
            "taken": []
          },
          "result": [
            "view bad: route must start with /",
            "view bad.b: section a is not single",
            "view bad.b: query has no parameter x",
            "view bad.b: title is not a reference field",
            "view bad.b: rank is not a string field",
            "view bad.c: section d itself depends on a section",
            "view bad.d: unknown section zz",
            "view bad.e: unknown query nothing"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-problems",
      "description": "schema.rs TenantSchema::problems: every problem of a schema in the order of the kernel's loop: the limits (object types, policies, queries, the limit of each query), object types (the field count, then per field and constraint, the retention), the permissions of roles, teams, invitations, policies, workflows, queries, views, then the composite unique constraints of each object type, the triggers, the automations and the tenant operations (definitions.rs), each in id order; the roles known are the schema's declared roles (genesis declares public and owner). The scoped role assignments follow the invitations (scoped-role-problems). Then the settings and the capabilities the schema declares (setting-problems, capability-problems), then the separations of duties (separation-problems). The ledger declarations follow (ledger-problems).",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "schema",
          "type": "tenant-schema"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "list<string>",
      "let": [
        {
          "name": "roles",
          "expr": "keys(schema.roles)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-objects",
          "expr": "fold(o in values(schema.objects), ps = [], concat(ps, call object-problems(schema, roles, o)))"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-policies",
          "expr": "fold(p in values(schema.policies), ps = [], concat(ps, call policy-problems(schema, roles, p)))"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-workflows",
          "expr": "fold(w in values(schema.workflows), ps = [], concat(ps, call workflow-problems(schema, roles, w)))"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-queries",
          "expr": "fold(q in values(schema.queries), ps = [], concat(ps, call query-problems(schema, roles, q)))"
        },
        {
          "name": "scan",
          "expr": "fold(w in values(schema.views), acc = route-scan{problems: [], routes: []}, route-scan{problems: concat(acc.problems, call view-problems(schema, w, acc.routes)), routes: concat(acc.routes, [w.route])})"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-uniques",
          "expr": "fold(o in values(schema.objects), ps = [], concat(ps, call unique-problems(o)))"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-triggers",
          "expr": "call trigger-problems(schema, roles)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-automations",
          "expr": "call automation-problems(schema, roles)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-operations",
          "expr": "call operation-problems(schema, roles)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-limits",
          "expr": "call schema-limit-problems(schema)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-role-permissions",
          "expr": "call role-permission-problems(schema, roles)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-teams",
          "expr": "call team-problems(schema, roles)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-invitations",
          "expr": "call invitation-problems(schema, roles)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-scoped",
          "expr": "call scoped-role-problems(schema)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-settings",
          "expr": "call setting-problems(schema)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-capabilities",
          "expr": "call capability-problems(schema)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-separations",
          "expr": "call separation-problems(schema)"
        },
        {
          "name": "p-ledger",
          "expr": "call ledger-problems(schema)"
        }
      ],
      "body": "concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(concat(p-limits, p-objects), p-role-permissions), p-teams), p-invitations), p-scoped), p-policies), p-workflows), p-queries), scan.problems), p-uniques), p-triggers), p-automations), p-operations), p-settings), p-capabilities), p-separations), p-ledger)",
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "testkit.rs notes_schema (objects, workflow and queries).",
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-5"
            }
          },
          "result": []
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "schema": {
              "fixture": "fx-tenant-schema-5",
              "with": {
                "objects.note.constraints.broken": {
                  "id": "broken",
                  "expr": {
                    "cmp": {
                      "op": "eq",
                      "left": {
                        "var": {
                          "scope": "new",
                          "field": "no_such_field"
                        }
                      },
                      "right": {
                        "lit": {
                          "str": "x"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "message": "never"
                },
                "policies.boss": {
                  "id": "boss",
                  "role": "owner",
                  "resource": "members",
                  "actions": [
                    "manage"
                  ]
                },
                "workflows.w": {
                  "id": "w",
                  "object": "tag",
                  "field": "status",
                  "initial": [
                    "draft"
                  ],
                  "transitions": [
                    {
                      "name": "publish",
                      "from": "draft",
                      "to": "published",
                      "guard": {
                        "cmp": {
                          "op": "eq",
                          "left": {
                            "var": {
                              "scope": "old",
                              "field": "$created_by"
                            }
                          },
                          "right": "principal"
                        }
                      },
                      "set": {
                        "published_at": "now"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "unpublish",
                      "from": "published",
                      "to": "draft",
                      "set": {
                        "published_at": {
                          "lit": "null"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "queries.q": {
                  "id": "q",
                  "object": "tag",
                  "params": [],
                  "order": []
                },
                "views.a": {
                  "id": "a",
                  "route": "/notes/:slug",
                  "title": "Note",
                  "sections": {
                    "note": {
                      "query": "note_by_slug",
                      "args": {
                        "slug": {
                          "route": "slug"
                        }
                      },
                      "include": [
                        "author"
                      ],
                      "markdown": [
                        "body"
                      ],
                      "single": true
                    },
                    "more": {
                      "query": "notes_by_rank",
                      "args": {},
                      "include": [],
                      "markdown": [],
                      "single": false
                    }
                  }
                },
                "views.b": {
                  "id": "b",
                  "route": "/notes/:slug",
                  "title": "Note",
                  "sections": {
                    "note": {
                      "query": "note_by_slug",
                      "args": {
                        "slug": {
                          "route": "slug"
                        }
                      },
                      "include": [
                        "author"
                      ],
                      "markdown": [
                        "body"
                      ],
                      "single": true
                    },
                    "more": {
                      "query": "notes_by_rank",
                      "args": {},
                      "include": [],
                      "markdown": [],
                      "single": false
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "result": [
            "note.broken: unknown field no_such_field",
            "policy boss: the owner role needs no policy",
            "workflow w: unknown object type tag",
            "query q: unknown object type tag",
            "view b: route /notes/:slug is already taken"
          ]
        },
        {
          "description": "A schema with a problem of each kind the kernel states, in its order: the limit of a query, a read condition, the permissions of roles, a team, an invitation, a policy (WG-5095, WG-5077).",
          "args": {
