    {
      "id": "change-schema",
      "description": "transition.rs change_schema: Manage on Schema is authorised; a stale expected version is SchemaConflict; no changes is InvalidIntent; more than 200 changes in one intent is LimitExceeded (KRN-1283); then the authority a change of definitions asks, and the built-in owner role is not redefined or removed while the tenant has an owner (require-owner-role-kept, ADM-1624); then the authority a change of definitions asks (require-definition-authority: automations-define for triggers and automations, the run-as roles of an automation under ADM-152, the step powers of a tenant operation under D-6547); then plan-migration, whose refusal keeps its kind, message and missing need with the draft's evidence before its own. The change's lines pass as schema:change, and every violation is a failed check existing:<object>/<id>:<rule>; in Reject mode any record that would not conform refuses the change with MigrationRejected (\"<n> existing record(s) ...\"), in Grandfather mode it is accepted: the new schema, the rewritten records (each with its RecordUpdated event after the SchemaChanged event, the record one version higher and updated now) and a SchemaChanged event counting the records that do not conform. The definitions of triggers and automations are stamped with their definer and time first (stamp-definitions, D-7204). After the plan, the overrides, revisions and events a change of setting definitions brings (setting-change-effects) follow the schema change in the delta and the events. After the authority, the limits of single accounts among the changes are checked and a unit or a pool an account names is not removed (ledger-removal-check, LDG-1549, LDG-1550, D-6554), and the commit puts or removes those limits in the ledger's storage after the settings' operations (ledger-limit-ops, WG-5172).",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "d",
          "type": "draft"
        },
        {
          "name": "changes",
          "type": "list<schema-change>"
        },
        {
          "name": "expected-version",
          "type": "option<schema-version>"
        },
        {
          "name": "existing",
          "type": "existing-data"
        }
      ],
      "returns": "decided",
      "errors": "rejection",
      "let": [
        {
          "name": "d1",
          "expr": "try call require(d, action.manage, resource.schema, subject{})"
        },
        {
          "name": "current",
          "expr": "d1.tenant.schema.version"
        },
        {
          "name": "stale",
          "expr": "match expected-version { Some(e) => e != current, None => false }"
        },
        {
          "name": "stamped",
          "expr": "call stamp-definitions(changes, d.ctx)"
        }
      ],
      "body": "if stale then fail(call draft-reject(d1.evidence, error-kind.schema-conflict, format('schema is at version {}, expected {}', current, match expected-version { Some(e) => e, None => 0 }))) else if changes == [] then fail(call draft-reject(d1.evidence, error-kind.invalid-intent, 'no changes given')) else if length(changes) > 200 then fail(call draft-reject(d1.evidence, error-kind.limit-exceeded, format('{} changes in one schema change is more than the maximum of 200', length(changes)))) else let d2 = try call require-definition-authority(d1, stamped) in let d2b = try call require-owner-role-kept(d2, stamped) in let d3 = try call ledger-removal-check(d2b, stamped) in let plan = match call plan-migration(d3.tenant, d3.coverage, stamped, d3.ctx.now) { Ok(m) => m, Err(e) => match e { rejected(err) => fail(rejection.rejected(domain-error{kind: err.kind, message: err.message, evidence: concat(d3.evidence, err.evidence), missing: err.missing})) } } in let fx = try call setting-change-effects(d3.tenant, stamped, d3.evidence) in let affected = fold(a in fold(k in sortBy(k in map(x in plan.violations, format('{}/{}', x.object, x.id)), k), ks = [], if any(a in ks, a == k) then ks else concat(ks, [k])), n = 0, n + 1) in let evidence = concat(concat(d3.evidence, map(l in plan.summary, check{rule: 'schema:change', passed: true, detail: l})), map(x in plan.violations, check{rule: format('existing:{}/{}:{}', x.object, x.id, x.check.rule), passed: false, detail: x.check.detail})) in if existing == existing-data.reject && affected > 0 then fail(call draft-reject(evidence, error-kind.migration-rejected, format('{} existing record(s) would not conform to the new schema', affected))) else if call owner-lost(d3.tenant.members, d3.tenant.schema, d3.tenant.members, plan.schema) then fail(call draft-reject(evidence, error-kind.last-owner, 'a tenant keeps at least one owner')) else match call duty-made-by(d3.tenant.members, d3.tenant.schema, d3.tenant.members, plan.schema) { Some(m) => fail(call draft-reject(evidence, error-kind.conflicting-roles, m)), None => decided{draft: draft{tenant: d3.tenant, ctx: d3.ctx, coverage: d3.coverage, ops: concat(concat(concat(concat(d3.ops, [delta-op.put-schema(plan.schema)]), fx.ops), call ledger-limit-ops(stamped)), map(r in plan.rewritten, delta-op.put-record(r))), events: concat(concat(concat(d3.events, [event-body.schema-changed{version: plan.schema.version, summary: plan.summary, grandfathered: affected}]), fx.events), map(r in plan.rewritten, event-body.record-updated{before: fold(b in values(match get(d3.tenant.records, r.object) { Some(m) => m, None => {} }), acc = r, if b.id == r.id then b else acc), after: r})), effects: d3.effects, evidence: evidence, next-record: d3.next-record}, output: output.schema{version: plan.schema.version}} }",
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "behaviour.rs a_strict_migration_is_rejected_when_existing_records_would_not_conform.",
          "args": {
            "d": {
              "fixture": "fx-draft-14"
            },
            "changes": [
              {
                "define-field": {
                  "object": "note",
                  "field": {
                    "id": "rank",
                    "label": "rank",
                    "ty": "int",
                    "required": true,
                    "unique": false
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "expected-version": null,
            "existing": "reject"
          },
          "error": {
            "rejected": {
              "kind": "migration-rejected",
              "message": "2 existing record(s) would not conform to the new schema",
              "evidence": [
                {
                  "rule": "policy:builtin_owner",
                  "passed": true,
                  "detail": "Manage on Schema"
                },
                {
                  "rule": "schema:change",
                  "passed": true,
                  "detail": "redefine field note.rank"
                },
                {
                  "rule": "existing:note/1:required:note.rank",
                  "passed": false,
                  "detail": "a value is required"
                },
                {
                  "rule": "existing:note/2:required:note.rank",
                  "passed": false,
                  "detail": "a value is required"
                }
              ],
              "missing": null
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "behaviour.rs a_grandfathered_migration_is_accepted_and_bites_on_the_next_write: the records that do not conform are listed in the change's own evidence.",
          "args": {
            "d": {
              "fixture": "fx-draft-14"
            },
            "changes": [
              {
                "define-field": {
                  "object": "note",
                  "field": {
                    "id": "rank",
                    "label": "rank",
                    "ty": "int",
                    "required": true,
                    "unique": false
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "expected-version": null,
            "existing": "grandfather"
          },
          "result": {
            "draft": {
              "tenant": {
                "id": "alpha",
                "name": "alpha",
                "revision": 7,
                "next-record": 3,
                "event-seq": 7,
                "schema": {
                  "version": 2,
                  "objects": {
                    "note": {
                      "id": "note",
                      "label": "Note",
                      "fields": {
                        "author": {
                          "id": "author",
                          "label": "Author",
                          "ty": {
                            "ref": {
                              "target": "person",
                              "on-delete": "set-null"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "body": {
                          "id": "body",
                          "label": "body",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "published_at": {
                          "id": "published_at",
                          "label": "published_at",
                          "ty": "time",
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "rank": {
                          "id": "rank",
                          "label": "rank",
                          "ty": "int",
                          "required": false,
                          "unique": false
                        },
                        "slug": {
                          "id": "slug",
                          "label": "slug",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": true,
                          "unique": true
                        },
                        "status": {
                          "id": "status",
                          "label": "status",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": true,
                          "unique": false,
                          "default": {
                            "lit": {
                              "str": "draft"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "title": {
                          "id": "title",
                          "label": "title",
                          "ty": "str",
                          "required": true,
                          "unique": false
                        }
                      },
                      "constraints": {
                        "title_length": {
                          "id": "title_length",
                          "expr": {
                            "cmp": {
                              "op": "le",
                              "left": {
                                "len": {
                                  "var": {
                                    "scope": "new",
                                    "field": "title"
                                  }
                                }
                              },
                              "right": {
                                "lit": {
