    {
      "id": "schema-with-scoped",
      "description": "The schema with its scoped role assignments replaced; a list left empty is none, so a schema that holds none hashes as one that never did (scoped.rs without, transition.rs assign_scoped_role).",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "schema",
          "type": "tenant-schema"
        },
        {
          "name": "held",
