    {
      "id": "team-member",
      "description": "transition.rs team_member: add a principal to a team or remove it. Authorised as Manage on Members; every role of the team must be one the principal may confer, whether adding or removing (require-conferrable), an addition must not give the person two duties kept apart (duty-made-by, ADM-1630), and a removal must leave the tenant an owner, counting the owners through teams (owner-lost). A removed member gets its own event with the roles it keeps, and its sessions are revoked when it keeps none.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "d",
          "type": "draft"
        },
        {
          "name": "team",
          "type": "team-id"
